1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,500
The pothole that did not

2
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,000
flatten your tire may still have cost you.

3
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,200
Impact can bend a wheel, knock out alignment,

4
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:10,000
or bruise the sidewall from the inside — where nothing shows.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,200
The tell is new pulling, new shaking,

6
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:17,000
or a slow leak that starts days later.

7
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,800
None of that shows on a walk-around —

8
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:23,000
it shows up on the road.

9
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Hit a bad one lately? Send this to someone who did.

10
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Nick's Tire and Auto — link in bio.
